{"id":"sh/gvaxczi1","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":208,"top":32,"width":1010,"height":48},"text":"PoS finality · 등록 포함과 확정 상태","style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#202C3C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/hwje54zm","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":56,"top":108,"width":1168,"height":52},"text":"거래 제출·블록 포함·최종 확정은 다르다. 현재 검증기는 노드가 보고한 finalized 기준을 사용한다.","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#526579","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/ut8fap0v","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":184,"width":698,"height":30},"text":"판정 조건과 시간 모델","style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#006F4C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/fu1w3uhg","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":222,"width":698,"height":308},"text":"F = eth_getBlockByNumber(\"finalized\", false)\nR = eth_getTransactionReceipt(txHash)\nB = eth_getBlockByNumber(R.blockNumber, false)\n\nrequire B.hash == R.blockHash\nif R.blockNumber > F.number: status = pending\n\nread authorizedIssuer() at blockNumber = F.number\nread records(documentId) at blockNumber = F.number\n\nissuedAt       = issuer-supplied uint64\nreceiptBlockTime = B.timestamp\nfinalizedBlock = F.number","style":{"fontSize":19.51,"typeface":"Consolas","color":"#202C3C","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/s7qx8zi5","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":822,"top":184,"width":390,"height":30},"text":"합의와 관측의 차이","style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#006F4C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/t8ze14zq","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":822,"top":222,"width":390,"height":308},"text":"PoS finality는 검증인 투표와\n체크포인트 합의에 기반한다.\n\n앱은 합의를 직접 검증하지 않고\nRPC가 제공하는 확정 블록을 읽는다.\n\n발급 기재시각은 체인이 부여하지 않는다.\n등록 블록 시각은 별도 값이다.\n\nfinalized 높이를 얻었다고\n확정된 정확한 벽시계 시각을 아는 것은 아니다.","style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#202C3C","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/v2xgrulc","kind":"shape","position":{"left":56,"top":556,"width":1168,"height":1},"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#202C3C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#D9E3E8","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/a1ofipkr","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":56,"top":570,"width":1168,"height":54},"text":"범위·한계  몇 초 경과 또는 N개 확인만으로 확정을 대신하지 않는다. 단일 RPC에 의존하며 TSA·공인시점 인증을 구현하지 않았다. 정상 합의의 안전성 전제를 둔다.","style":{"fontSize":18.51,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#526579","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/x4zytk3i","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":56,"top":635,"width":1168,"height":20},"text":"[1] Ethereum, Proof-of-stake / Finality  https://ethereum.org/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/","style":{"fontSize":12.71,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#526579","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/w3qxkz2x","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":56,"top":656,"width":1168,"height":20},"text":"[2] Ethereum, JSON-RPC API  https://ethereum.org/developers/docs/apis/json-rpc/","style":{"fontSize":12.71,"typeface":"Pretendard","color":"#526579","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","lineWidth":0},
